{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Miaotofu01/Dida-TUI/issues/41","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Miaotofu01/Dida-TUI","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Miaotofu01/Dida-TUI/issues/41/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Miaotofu01/Dida-TUI/issues/41/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Miaotofu01/Dida-TUI/issues/41/events","html_url":"https://github.com/Miaotofu01/Dida-TUI/issues/41","id":5708657063,"node_id":"I_kwDOU7m4nM8AAAABVEMxpw","number":41,"title":"刷新拿全、不残留：清单索引翻页 + 剪枝","user":{"login":"Miaotofu01","id":196646782,"node_id":"U_kgDOC7iXfg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/196646782?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Miaotofu01","html_url":"https://github.com/Miaotofu01","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Miaotofu01/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Miaotofu01/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Miaotofu01/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Miaotofu01/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Miaotofu01/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Miaotofu01/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Miaotofu01/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Miaotofu01/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Miaotofu01/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":12540536715,"node_id":"LA_kwDOU7m4nM8AAAAC63lniw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Miaotofu01/Dida-TUI/labels/ready-for-agent","name":"ready-for-agent","color":"0E8A16","default":false,"description":"Fully specified, ready for an AFK agent","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":0,"created_at":"2026-10-05T08:13:33Z","updated_at":"2026-10-05T08:17:31Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"OWNER","active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":1,"total_blocked_by":1,"blocking":1,"total_blocking":1},"body":"## Parent\n\n#30\n\n## What to build\n\n全量刷新有两个会让客户端「看不见东西」或「看见不存在的东西」的缺陷，都是 v1 留下的，全量客户端会撞上。\n\n**1. 清单索引要翻页拿完。** 服务端清单索引接口的 `limit` 默认 200，而刷新的读路径从不带分页参数，所以**第 201 个清单起永远看不见**。要让它翻页取完，并且在拿不全时不要假装拿全了。\n\n> 核对过的实情：API 客户端本身**会**带上 `offset`/`limit`，缺的是刷新路径从不翻页。工单按这个事实写，不要写成「客户端丢参数」。\n\n**2. 刷新要剪枝。** 落库现在只做插入与更新，从不删除：远端已经删掉的任务会永远留在本地库里，删掉的清单会永远留在清单列表页上。远端已经不存在的任务与清单必须从本地库里剪掉。\n\n剪枝是清单删除那张工单的前置——没有它，删掉的清单刷新一次就又回来了。\n\n## Acceptance criteria\n\n- [ ] 清单索引超过 200 条时刷新能拿全（用假后端返回多于服务端默认上限的清单来钉死）\n- [ ] 翻页取不全时不假装拿全了，有明确信号\n- [ ] 远端已不存在的任务在刷新后从本地库消失\n- [ ] 远端已不存在的清单在刷新后从本地库消失，也不再出现在清单列表页\n- [ ] 剪枝不误删待推送改动对应的任务\n- [ ] 一次刷新里删掉多条远端记录时，不会把未受影响的本地改动一起清掉\n\n## Blocked by\n\n- #32\n","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Miaotofu01/Dida-TUI/issues/41/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Miaotofu01/Dida-TUI/issues/41/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null}